1
00:00:00,666 --> 00:00:02,246
(Leonard:)What about it?

2
00:00:02,751 --> 00:00:05,921
Well, the thing is,
the date didn't go that well.

3
00:00:06,088 --> 00:00:09,178
Oh. Too bad. You know...

4
00:00:09,383 --> 00:00:12,053
(Leonard:)I guess the thing to do now is,
you know, pick yourself up.

5
00:00:12,219 --> 00:00:14,049
Dust yourself off, forget it. Move on.

6
00:00:14,221 --> 00:00:17,061
- I can't do that.
- Why the hell not?

7
00:00:17,558 --> 00:00:19,848
Because we're going out again tomorrow.

8
00:00:20,018 --> 00:00:21,228
Excuse me, Stuart?

9
00:00:21,395 --> 00:00:22,975
(Sheldon:)- Have you read the new Flash?
- No.

10
00:00:23,147 --> 00:00:26,647
(Sheldon:)Well, I have,
and it will knock your socks off.

11
00:00:27,734 --> 00:00:29,194
(Sheldon:)Good luck getting them back on.

12
00:00:33,073 --> 00:00:35,823
Anyway, I figure this is probably
my last shot with Penny...

13
00:00:35,993 --> 00:00:38,953
- ...and I don't wanna screw it up.
- Oh, nobody wants that.

14
00:00:39,121 --> 00:00:40,251
So here's my question:

15
00:00:40,414 --> 00:00:46,084
(Stuart:)It's the second date. You think
she'll be expecting things to get physical?

16
00:00:48,672 --> 00:00:50,302
(Leonard:)Oh, gee.

17
00:00:51,466 --> 00:00:53,716
Yeah, my initial reaction is no.

18
00:00:53,886 --> 00:00:57,096
But, you know, let me think about it
and get back to you, okay?

19
00:00:57,264 --> 00:00:58,894
(Stuart:)Okay. So you'll give me a call?

20
00:00:59,057 --> 00:01:01,147
- Yeah, or you call me.
- Great.

21
00:01:02,144 --> 00:01:03,974
(Leonard:)Or nobody calls anyone.

22
00:01:05,147 --> 00:01:09,737
(Raj:)Interesting, Penny's current suitor
asking advice from her former suitor.

23
00:01:09,902 --> 00:01:13,112
Yeah, thanks for closed-captioning
my pain, Raj.

24
00:01:13,488 --> 00:01:15,778
You wanna make sure he gets nowhere
with Penny...

25
00:01:15,949 --> 00:01:19,039
(Howard:)...without jeopardizing your friendship
with either of them?

26
00:01:19,203 --> 00:01:20,913
- I'm listening.
- Just tell him...

27
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:29,019
(Howard:)...to do everything you've done with her
for the last two years.

